Show a clear project schedule classification:

- Ahead of Schedule.
- On Schedule.
- At Risk.
- Behind Schedule.
- Delayed.
- Completed.

Use configurable thresholds and valid schedule data.

If the project is delayed, show an explanation only if an authorized person has approved it for client publication.

