## 19.13 Client Portal security and confidentiality

The Client Portal must use strict server-side access controls.

Never expose:

- Internal company dashboard.
- Project budgets.
- Expense records.
- Actual internal costs.
- Profit and margin information.
- Supplier prices.
- Internal quotations.
- Purchase requests.
- Procurement details.
